        <obo:IAO_0000115>The hydrolysis of proteins into smaller polypeptides and/or amino acids by cleavage of their peptide bonds.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Proteolysis</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>peptidolysis</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>ATP-dependent proteolysis</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
