        <obo:IAO_0000115>The directed movement of molecules between the nucleus and the cytoplasm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>GO:0000063</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>nucleocytoplasmic shuttling</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
