        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0006950"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell or an organism (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of oxidative stress, a state often resulting from exposure to high levels of reactive oxygen species, e.g. superoxide anions, hydrogen peroxide (H2O2), and hydroxyl radicals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
