    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007339 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007339">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0035036"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which the sperm binds to the zona pellucida glycoprotein layer of the egg. The process begins with the attachment of the sperm plasma membrane to the zona pellucida and includes attachment of the acrosome inner membrane to the zona pellucida after the acrosomal reaction takes place.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ZPG binding</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0007339</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>binding of sperm to zona pellucida</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007339"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The process in which the sperm binds to the zona pellucida glycoprotein layer of the egg. The process begins with the attachment of the sperm plasma membrane to the zona pellucida and includes attachment of the acrosome inner membrane to the zona pellucida after the acrosomal reaction takes place.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GOC:dph</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0878932437</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007340 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007340">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0022414"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007338"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The discharge, by sperm, of a single, anterior secretory granule following the sperm&apos;s attachment to the zona pellucida of the oocyte. The process begins with the fusion of the outer acrosomal membrane with the sperm plasma membrane and ends with the exocytosis of the acrosomal contents into the zona pellucida.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Acrosome_reaction</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0007340</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>If the release of the acrosome content occurs before the sperm reaches the zona pellucida, consider using premature acrosome loss.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>acrosome reaction</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007340"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The discharge, by sperm, of a single, anterior secretory granule following the sperm&apos;s attachment to the zona pellucida of the oocyte. The process begins with the fusion of the outer acrosomal membrane with the sperm plasma membrane and ends with the exocytosis of the acrosomal contents into the zona pellucida.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GOC:dph</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:11175768</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:21042299</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:3886029</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007341 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007341">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0044706"/>
