            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The infiltration by sperm of the zona pellucida to reach the oocyte. The process involves digestive enzymes from a modified lysosome called the acrosome, situated at the head of the sperm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
