        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0048513"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of sensory organs over time, from its formation to the mature structure.</obo:IAO_0000115>
