        <obo:IAO_0000115>The series of events required for an organism to receive a sensory chemical stimulus, convert it to a molecular signal, and recognize and characterize the signal. This is a neurological process.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>chemosensory perception</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
