            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of the chemical reactions and pathways resulting in the formation of substances.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of anabolism</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
