            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The component of a membrane consisting of the gene products having some covalently attached portion, for example part of a peptide sequence or some other covalently attached group such as a GPI anchor, which spans or is embedded in one or both leaflets of the membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>intrinsic to membrane</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>cellular_component</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
