        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>cellular_component</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0036126</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that cilia and eukaryotic flagella are deemed to be equivalent. In this case community usage is always &apos;flagellum&apos;, hence the primary term name, but the cilium parentage is deliberate.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>sperm flagellum</rdfs:label>
