    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0036157">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005858"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Outer arm structure present on the outer doublet microtubules of ciliary and flagellar axonemes. Outer dynein arms contain 2-3 heavy chains, two or more intermediate chains and a cluster of 4-8 light chains. Inner and outer dynein arms have different functions in the generation of microtubule-based motility.</obo:IAO_0000115>
