        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0071555"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The series of events leading to chemical and structural alterations of an existing cell wall that can result in loosening, increased extensibility or disassembly.</obo:IAO_0000115>
