            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A reflex that occurs in response to suckling, beginning with a nerve impulse from a receptor in the mammary gland and ending with the ejection of milk from the gland. Signaling never reaches a level of consciousness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
