        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#prokaryote_subset"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that this term represents a grouping class that includes all proteins that use ATP hydrolysis to drive a reaction; it is not meant to capture the ATP hydrolysis reaction itself. To annotate ATP hydrolysis, please use &apos;ATP hydrolysis activity ; GO:0016887&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
